# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Copper .gitignore
# NOTHING private about a real person or conversation may be committed.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── WhatsApp session (CRITICAL) ──
# This is a live login to your WhatsApp account — cookies, tokens, the works.
# Committing it hands anyone who reads the repo control of your WhatsApp. Never.
.wwebjs_auth/
.wwebjs_cache/

# ── Private conversation data & people network ──
# Real message history, translation cache, usage logs, and the per-person
# relationship files (names, phone numbers, life details, photos).
copper/store/
copper/logs/
copper/people/
media/
outgoing/

# ── Real configuration (contains a real contact's phone number) ──
# Ship copper.example.json instead; each user creates their own copper.json.
copper/copper.json

# ── Secrets / tokens ──
# Bot tokens, API keys — anything that grants control. Never commit.
.env
*.env
**/.env

# ── Node ──
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*

# ── .NET build output ──
bin/
obj/
*.user

# ── OS / editor cruft ──
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
.vs/
.idea/
